{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶紅地氈向來是女藝人們的美麗戰場，今年《聲夢傳奇》和《聲秀》的小花們首次集體亮相，成功搶盡風頭。當中20歲的《聲秀》學員陳卓怡以白色低胸晚裝震撼全場，豐滿上圍配合黑色束帶設計，令她瞬間成為全晚最搶鏡的焦點。而《聲夢傳奇》的鍾柔美和詹天文同樣以性感造型登場，展現出新生代女藝人的青春魅力，網民紛紛...</p>\n\n回顧去年TVB台慶紅地氈，不少《聲秀》小花們首次亮相，成功搶盡風頭。當中20歲的《聲秀》學員陳卓怡以白色低胸晚裝震撼全場，豐滿上圍配合黑色束帶設計，令她瞬間成為全晚最搶鏡的焦點，同樣由《聲秀》出道的周智敏亦展現好身材，網民紛紛截圖討論她們的驚艷表現。<a></a>\n<h2>回顧聲夢聲秀小花台慶首次亮相搶鏡造型 20歲陳卓怡白色低胸震撼全場目錄</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a>台慶紅地氈回顧｜聲秀陳卓怡Hoonry白色戰衣豐滿上圍震撼全場</a></li>\n<li><a>聲秀出身周智敏金色深V禮服有睇頭</a></li>\n<li><a>《聲秀》甄敏芳（Jenny）</a></li>\n<li><a>亞軍Ophelia化身公主</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<p>年僅20歲的《聲秀》學員陳卓怡今年首次參與台慶紅地氈，雖然與一眾《聲秀》學員以大堆頭形式登場，但她憑藉一身白色低胸背心晚裝成功突圍而出。黑色束帶設計完美突顯她豐滿的上圍，低胸剪裁令「事業線」盡露，極度震撼眼球。在隨後的抽獎環節中，Hoonry幸運中獎上台領獎，偉大身材再次暴露於觀眾眼前，不過面對鏡頭時顯得相當怕羞，頻頻用手擋住胸前試圖「封印」豐滿曲線。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155518339296_6607475216_4708455006921607f5c661-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"聲夢傳奇 聲秀 （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155518339296_6607475216_4708455006921607f5c661-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509949910_6607475216_29841482369216081bcf28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509949910_6607475216_29841482369216081bcf28-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155677689864_6607475216_17784486166921607d1146e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155677689864_6607475216_17784486166921607d1146e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509938694_6607475216_12752163606921607acfce5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509938694_6607475216_12752163606921607acfce5-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>聲秀出身周智敏金色深V禮服有睇頭</h2>\n<p>同樣來自《聲秀》的周智敏當晚選擇以金色深V晚裝上陣，性感造型同樣吸引不少目光。2005年出生的她現於香港浸會大學就讀流行音樂系，今年參加《聲秀》成功入圍8強。Emily在社交平台上分享當晚造型時坦言「呢件禮服有啲令人唔敢直視」，更透露這是她第一次參與台慶便意外中獎，顯得相當興奮。金色禮服配合深V設計，展現出她的青春活力和自信魅力。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582914575_17909002329259339_4335939420895462175_n_1828596272691fdc512bf3e-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"聲夢傳奇 聲秀 （圖片來源：周智敏IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582914575_17909002329259339_4335939420895462175_n_1828596272691fdc512bf3e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周智敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6125006746221742977_1923674940691fdc4fd09c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1190\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6125006746221742977_1923674940691fdc4fd09c5-1024x1269.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：周智敏IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6125006746221742978_54216943691fdc4e4f9c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1278\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/6125006746221742978_54216943691fdc4e4f9c0-1024x1363.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：周智敏IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582949134_17909002338259339_5694543733979531406_n_2024712900691fdc5305798.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582949134_17909002338259339_5694543733979531406_n_2024712900691fdc5305798-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：周智敏IG）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>《聲秀》甄敏芳（Jenny）</h2>\n<p>以露肩禮裙亮相的甄敏芳（Jenny）身穿花花裙，猶如花仙子般仙氣滿瀉！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/94c7a470-9082-4fe9-b732-b560029fdce4_1815355413691fddbd4a78e.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"聲夢傳奇 聲秀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"902\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/94c7a470-9082-4fe9-b732-b560029fdce4_1815355413691fddbd4a78e.jpeg\" width=\"727\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/509abe05-848a-4c2b-a563-499fd868ec7e_493237066af9dc1f14ecd-1024x1235.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1158\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/509abe05-848a-4c2b-a563-499fd868ec7e_493237066af9dc1f14ecd-1024x1235.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ffb3f533-4cc0-4a69-9919-b85538307f20_15900720896af9dc2175627.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1243\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ffb3f533-4cc0-4a69-9919-b85538307f20_15900720896af9dc2175627.jpg\" width=\"1012\"/></a></p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/oyfeii_1763813655_3771459060944730272_3654932733_13466726436af9dc234405f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1791\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/oyfeii_1763813655_3771459060944730272_3654932733_13466726436af9dc234405f.jpg\" width=\"1440\"/></a></p>\n<p><a></a> </p>\n<h2>亞軍Ophelia化身公主</h2>\n<p>化身公主的Ophelia白皙肌膚及甜美笑容非常搶鏡，網民激讚被靚暈！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/oyfeii_1763813655_3771459045786465104_3654932733_13723929396af9dc25b444d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1792\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/oyfeii_1763813655_3771459045786465104_3654932733_13723929396af9dc25b444d.jpg\" width=\"1440\"/></a></p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/oyfeii_1763813655_3771459010831133517_3654932733_8620119736af9dc283de8a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1791\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/oyfeii_1763813655_3771459010831133517_3654932733_8620119736af9dc283de8a.jpg\" width=\"1440\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n<br/><a>回到目錄</a> <br/>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T16:45:12.947729+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1189,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T16:27:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T20:20:34.061334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T16:38:11.310254+00:00","content_hash":"241dea57517844fb00411961f60d7ac58ccc9583d6ad814e52c783dffda589ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}